se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nWang Zhi and Liu Mei are colleagues, and they worked together on an urgent project. After completing the project, Wang Zhi is very happy and says to Liu Mei, \"We really did a great job, and I am proud.\" The leader publicly praised the project team and promoted and gave a raise to Liu Mei. However, Wang Zhi's expression becomes somewhat disheartened.\n\n[Question]\nWang Zhi expresses pride but appears depressed?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Wang Zhi is proud of the project's success, but is depressed because he feels the leader does not recognize his hard work in the project.\nB. Wang Zhi is proud of the project's success, but is depressed because he does not fully utilize his potential in the project.\nC. Wang Zhi is proud of the project's success, but is depressed because his colleagues do not give enough recognition.\nD. Wang Zhi is proud of the project's success, but is depressed because he feels exhausted from putting too much into the project.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002472563036101251,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e3c4d6006945d280607c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368452171,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:40:52","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"2f6d58c624aa4eb9b5019e20d098ddeb"}